SCORE 13.03 04/03/2013
-----------
* Bugfix.


SCORE 13.02 28/02/2013
-----------
* Corrected bug: heap not cleaned after removing plot files.
* Mutexed generation of day plot.  Using simple locked file mechanism:
  First process generates file Mutex_Day_yyymmdd, removes file when done.
  If this file exists, next process waits until file is removed.
  If still waiting after 10 seconds, next process will continue anyhow, and
  will try to remove the file.
* Added new debug option -ddl: will provide debug output for the dislin picture
  generation functions.


SCORE 13.01 24/01/2013
-----------
* Added fields to the dat file:
  - Take-off point latitude co-ordinate
  - Take-off point longitude co-ordinate
  - Landing point latitude co-ordinate
  - Landing point longitude co-ordinate
  - Distance take-off to landing point
* Creates file Day_yyyymmdd, where yyyy is the year, mm the month and dd is the
  day of the flight.
  - The file contains all flights of a single competition day
    in floating point radians Lat;Long.  The fights are separated by 0;0
    co-ordinates.  Upon every run of the algorithm, the flight is added.
    If the algorithm is ran several times on the same flight, the flight will be
    inserted multiple times, as well.
  - To reduce the file size, minimal fix distance is set at 2 km. 
  - Flights will be included only if:
    - Departure within Benelux
    - Free flight scoring distance of at least 150 km.
* From the file above, the graph day_yyymmdd.png is generated.  The graph is
  generated again upon every instance, so it will be updated for every flight.


